{"id":"haricot","lemma":"haricot","pos":"noun","rank":3472,"glosses":["A stew of lamb and vegetables.","A bean; a green bean (also known as a string bean or snap bean).","The plant from which the green bean is cultivated: the common bean (Phaseolus vulgaris)."],"ipa":"/a.ʁi.ko/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/ce/Fr-haricot.ogg/Fr-haricot.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"haricots"},"formAudio":{"haricots":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c7/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-J%C3%A9r%C3%A9my-G%C3%BCnther-Heinz_J%C3%A4hnick-haricots.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je déteste les haricots.","en":"I hate beans.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/204038","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hate, to detest","l":"détester"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Qui aime les haricots ?","en":"Who likes beans?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/172595","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to love","l":"aimer"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Je mange des haricots.","en":"I eat beans.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to eat","l":"manger"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"Ces haricots étaient bons.","en":"Those beans were good.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"good","l":"bon"}]},{"text":"Tu commences à me porter sur le haricot.","en":"You're starting to get on my nerves.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to begin, commence","l":"commencer"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to carry"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}